<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -- Morgan on oil, natgas prices, cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -- Morgan on oil, natgas prices, cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its 1997 estimate on West Texas Intermediate crude to $20 per barrel from $18.50 and its estimate on natural gas for next year to $2.25 per thousand cubic feet (MCF) from $2.</p>
<p>-- Morgan also upgraded USX-Marathon Group and Louis Dreyfus Natural Gas Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
</text>
